[
    {
        "id": "10015035e2982",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "a1b2c3d4e5f60001",
        "name": "Monitoring: decode the bus and cache every variable",
        "info": "The master broadcasts only seven registers (2AH 2BH 2CH 32H-35H) every\n12 seconds. Everything else must be polled with a GET request - see the\npoll branch at the bottom.\n\nReplace the injects with your serial in / mqtt in node: valloxrx takes\nraw bytes and does its own framing, so partial chunks are fine.\n\nThe injects below replay real frames (master 0x11 -> all panels 0x20)\nso the flow can be tried without hardware. One carries a deliberately\nbroken checksum to exercise the error output.\n\n\"read cached state\" sends an empty payload, which makes the vallox node\nemit its whole snapshot on output 1.",
        "x": 240,
        "y": 40,
        "wires": []
    },
